"""Apply the owner's whole-world plasticine correction and three-identity cast."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,re,fcntl
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];BASE=ROOT.parents[1]
WORLD='''HARD MATERIAL RULE: the WHOLE WORLD is handmade PLASTICINE. Nothing around the characters may ever look more realistic than the characters. Every person, food item, cup, appliance, plant, building and piece of furniture is made from equally simplified matte moulded clay. Premium friendly soft stop-motion set: broad rounded sculpted masses, softly uneven hand-formed edges, a few broad tool/finger impressions, gentle warm light and ambient occlusion. Never photographic surface microdetail. Hair is always visibly unnatural solid plasticine: thick rounded locks/coils/locs, broad sculpted grooves, no individual hairs, flyaways, fibers, fuzz or scalp stubble. Eyebrows are simple clay reliefs. Clothes are solid clay with a few broad folds, no weave, stitching or realistic fabric grain. Skin is smooth clay with no pores. Food recognition comes from silhouette and a few big colored shapes: croissants have ONLY 3–5 smooth rounded clay rolls/grooves, no flakes, crumb pores, real lamination, seeds or crumbs; opened pastry shows a simple cream clay interior and broad brown chocolate clay filling. Coffee is a smooth brown clay disk with a few broad cream clay milk-art shapes, not real bubbles or foam microtexture; pouring milk/espresso is a simple coherent clay ribbon connecting its real source to the receiving cup. Pasta is a few thick clay noodles with simple red tomato and green leaf shapes, no grated-cheese particles or realistic sauce texture. Fruit is smooth colored clay with no skin/seeds/fuzz. Glass/drinks use simple soft translucent plastic/clay forms and a few chunky ice pieces, not optical liquid simulation. Tables and shelves are plain warm-brown clay, no wood grain. Machines are rounded gray/charcoal clay, no real chrome, steel brushing or intricate reflections. Plants have a few thick sculpted leaves, no veins. Walls/tiles are broad smooth clay forms, no stone, brick, paint or terrazzo microtexture. Sunny yellow accents, sage/teal, dusty pink, warm cream/off-white, charcoal and warm brown throughout. Match the provided plasticine cafe master, not realistic food photography or a realistic room with cartoon people composited into it.'''
IDENTITIES='''REUSE THE ESTABLISHED CAST; never invent a new face or replace them with generic people. CREATOR: the exact young-looking woman from her saved model reference, warm medium-tan skin, big simple dark eyes, dark-brown wavy plasticine ponytail, yellow T-shirt, sage trousers, off-white shoes and dusty-pink crossbody bag on her RIGHT hip, strap over LEFT shoulder. BARISTA: the exact young-looking light-medium warm-skinned man from his reference, short swept dark-brown moulded plasticine locks, ivory shirt, sage apron with yellow straps when in cafe/bakery staff role. FRIEND_LOCS: the exact user-accepted youthful Black male friend, fixed warm deep-brown face and accepted age appearance, short thick outward-pointing dark plasticine locs, ivory T-shirt, loose sage/mint trousers and off-white sneakers with yellow details. Do not age him up/down. Keep each face, proportions, skin tone and hair silhouette consistent. In professional/exercise scenes, adapt clothing only as the job requires while preserving identity; remove the pink bag during exercise or treatment. A character cannot appear twice as two different people in one scene. Only introduce a background extra/child if the actual scene requires one and the established cast cannot fill that role. Do not add people to object-only scenes.'''
CONSTRAINTS='''One single full-bleed 9:16 portrait image, no borders or panels. Exact instructional subject, action, starting framing and visitor-accessible camera angle take priority over decoration. Camera stays in ordinary customer/visitor space: never behind a staff counter or till, inside a kitchen or at a restricted bench. Show work across the public boundary; do not invent special access. Personal food plates belong at usable off-centre place settings, fully supported, never at the centre of the dining table. At most TWO visible attached hands TOTAL across the image, including partial/background hands: natural fingers, no detached or duplicated limbs. Crop all other hands out. No text, typography, pseudo-lettering, numbers, brand marks, watermark, UI, viewfinder, guidelines or arrows. Menus/signs/receipts have only blank fields or simple non-letter pictograms. No pictured filming phone/camera; a handset/camera is allowed only when it is the explicitly named repair subject. Laptop/screens stay blank. Makeup and brows remain schematic, no detailed lashes or skin. No nude person or private clinic records.'''
FRIEND_SCRIPTS={'restaurant-chef-pick','pro-first-lesson','shop-music-demo','fit-first-class','fit-coach-move','fun-group-challenge'}
FIXED={
'cafe-seasonal-drink':'ONE iced cinnamon/caramel latte in the SAME clear straight tumbler with chunky clay ice, creamy amber clay coffee, simple cinnamon foam and a muted-green straw. Never a white ceramic mug or paper cup. Build precedes foam; finished drink always has the same appearance.',
'cafe-morning-ritual':'One white clay latte cup/saucer, one plate with TWO ALREADY OPENED chocolate-filled clay croissant halves, wooden-color clay table, sage chair and open book in the corner step. Pastry stays supported with brown clay filling visible. No pulling or replacement whole pastry.',
'cafe-work-spot':'White clay latte cup, opened clay croissant on a plate, sage chair, warm-brown clay table, book/laptop and customer outlet. No person seated opposite the POV viewer.',
'bakery-fresh-batch':'Same golden chocolate-filled clay croissant throughout, whole for tray/pick, opened only for inside/detail. Same yellow/sage public bakery.',
'bakery-morning-shift':'Same cream/sage public bakery and golden clay croissants, raw clay dough only in the dough step, same tray/case/selected product.',
'bakery-sell-out':'Same golden chocolate-filled clay croissant and cream/yellow awning, sage bakery case. Do not substitute another food.',
'bakery-box':'EXACTLY THREE items in the same open box: one clay croissant, one dusty-pink berry swirl, one chocolate muffin. No additional items. Pick shows one whole item entering the same box, not a cut pastry on a plate.',
'bakery-ask-the-baker':'Same male barista-identity baker and one golden chocolate-filled clay croissant as the recommendation; all staff activity seen from public side.',
'salon-fade':'Client is the BARISTA identity in ivory casual shirt, without apron; before has overgrown short clay hair, after a smooth stylized clay fade. Provider is CREATOR identity in sage professional clothing. Do not put the female narrator in front of the male client for before/reveal. Fade is represented by broad clay color/height bands, never realistic hair fibers or stubble.',
'salon-transformation':'CREATOR identity is the client; BARISTA identity is the hair professional in sage work clothes. Same face; unfinished/tied hair before, loose smoothly sculpted clay waves after. Treatment hair consists of broad solid clay locks with simplified clay/gray foil panels, never silky individual strands.',
'salon-quick-tour':'Same compact salon, sage chair, cream towels, simple clay mirrors and treatment area. Staff is BARISTA identity in sage professional clothing, visitor is CREATOR identity.',
'salon-nail-set':'CREATOR identity client, BARISTA identity nail professional. One consistent dusty-pink clay manicure with a simple yellow/sage accent nail. In work show only ONE client hand and ONE professional brush hand; do not show a third supporting hand. Finished-hand/turns shows ONE finished hand only, no brush/application.',
'salon-brows':'Same CREATOR client and BARISTA professional. Eyebrows and cosmetics are simple sculpted clay reliefs. No realistic brow hair, lashes or skin texture.',
'salon-meet-stylist':'The stylist is BARISTA identity in sage salon work clothing. CREATOR is the client/visitor. All hair is broad solid plasticine locks; blow-dry brush has a few big clay studs rather than photoreal bristles.',
'restaurant-date-night':'Same two-person clay restaurant and usable opposed place settings. CREATOR and BARISTA identities are visitors; man has ivory casual shirt, no cafe apron. One coherent pasta dish on a diner-side plate, never centrally on the table.',
'restaurant-chef-pick':'FRIEND_LOCS is the visitor, BARISTA identity is the chef in ivory/sage work clothes. Same tomato clay pasta dish throughout; guest-side presentation only, no kitchen access.',
'fun-first-try':'Same small public clay amusement park with a gentle yellow/sage carousel and a simple ticket stand. Ride POV is from an allowed visitor seat/chest camera position, no device pictured; park wide view from public ground, never a restricted elevated camera.',
'fun-group-challenge':'Same BOWLING ALLEY with sage/yellow clay ball return, warm-brown clay lane and simple white clay pins. Use the THREE established identities as friends, no aprons. In group frames only two total hands may be visible; other hands hidden/cropped. No cafe or unrelated arcade.',
'fit-first-class':'FRIEND_LOCS visitor in ivory athletic shirt/sage joggers, CREATOR identity coach in yellow/sage athletic clothes. Same kettlebell class, correct full-body stance, no bags during exercise.',
'fit-coach-move':'Same FRIEND_LOCS visitor and CREATOR coach; ONE beginner kettlebell squat throughout, same bell. No bags, unrelated exercise or changed identities.',
'fit-sauna-session':'CREATOR visitor wears a CLOSED cream spa robe or securely wrapped towel, no street bag; same clay cedar-colored sauna and quiet rest area.',
'fit-treatment':'Same quiet massage studio. ONE attached professional hand glides on a small cropped back/shoulder area above a cream clay towel; person otherwise covered. No full torso needed, no IV gear, no irrelevant stock hand pose.',
'fit-first-appointment':'Same empty cream/sage clinic, CREATOR visitor and BARISTA identity clinician in ivory coat. No other patients or named records.'}

def main():
 source=json.loads((BASE/'guides/script_templates.json').read_text());ts={t['id']:t for t in source['templates']};steps={(t['id'],s['id']):s for t in source['templates'] for s in t['steps']};notes=json.loads((BASE/'previews/continuity.json').read_text())
 with (ROOT/'.lock').open('a') as lock:
  fcntl.flock(lock,fcntl.LOCK_EX);m=json.loads((ROOT/'manifest.json').read_text())
  m.update(art_direction='hand-moulded-plasticine-v2',art_direction_revision=2,status='material_revision_and_remaining_generation',cast=['creator','barista','friend_locs'],style_reference='references/plasticine-world.png')
  for e in m['entries']:
   t=ts[e['template']];s=steps[e['template'],e['step']];framing=e['source_plan']['start'];front=e.get('render_shot')=='selfie';visitor='friend_locs' if e['template'] in FRIEND_SCRIPTS else 'barista' if e['template']=='salon-fade' else 'creator';e['visitor_character']=visitor
   if e.get('source'):e['previous_art_direction']=e.get('art_direction','soft-clay-v1');e['status']='needs_regeneration';e['review']='Owner tightened the whole world to plasticine: replace realistic food/hair/materials, preserve scene and cast.'
   if front:cam=f'FRONT-CAMERA portrait of the {visitor.upper()} visiting character looking directly into the lens, face and upper body visible, relevant venue/product beside or behind. No view of their back or empty facade instead; filming phone outside the frame.'
   elif s['shot']=='pov' or e['source_plan']['angle']=='pov':cam='STRICT first-person POV: viewer IS the visitor; their own face/head/torso must not appear. Only task-relevant attached hands may enter from the lower edge. No person facing the camera as a narrator.'
   elif framing=='wide':cam='Genuinely WIDE establishing/activity shot of the named venue or whole-body action, with simple depth-separated clay landmarks. No large foreground portrait. Incidental hands hidden.'
   elif framing in ['close','detail']:cam='Tight CLOSE/DETAIL of the actual named object, working hand or body part, dominating the frame. Crop unrelated faces, full torso and room out.'
   else:cam='MEDIUM shot through the visitor camera at the actual named subject/action plus useful context. No foreground narrator or person filming.'
   action=e['actual_direction']
   if e['stem']=='salon-nail-set_turns':action='One finished client hand turns gently to show the same dusty-pink clay manicure with a simple yellow/sage accent nail. ONLY ONE HAND. No brush, no painting, no professional supporting hand.'
   if e['stem']=='restaurant-date-night_outro':action='Front-camera portrait giving the meal verdict with the same diner-side table behind. A blank receipt may be held, but NO phone/handset appears in the scene.'
   if e['stem']=='bakery-sell-out_hook':action='Front-camera portrait of CREATOR outside the bakery, looking into the lens, shopfront and a small queue behind; no back view.'
   if e['stem']=='bakery-fresh-batch_pick':action='Visitor POV: one whole chocolate-filled clay croissant is placed on a small customer plate across the public case. One plate-supporting customer hand and one staff tong hand maximum. No opened/custard pastry.'
   if e['stem']=='bakery-box_pick':action='Customer-side high close selection: one whole clay croissant is placed into the same plain yellow/cream box with tongs, while the berry swirl and chocolate muffin wait in the case. No cut pastry on a plate.'
   continuity=FIXED.get(e['template'],' '.join(notes.get(e['template'],[])).replace('terracotta jacket','sunny-yellow clay jacket').replace('terracotta cap','dusty-pink clay cap'))
   p=f'''{WORLD}\nEXACT SCENE: {t['title']} / {e['title']}.\nCAMERA CONTRACT: {cam}\nVIEW ANGLE: {e['camera_description']}; starting framing {framing}.\nREQUIRED ACTION: {action}\nSCENE/PROP CONTINUITY: {continuity}\n{IDENTITIES}\n{CONSTRAINTS}\nThis is ONE useful instant of this exact shot, not a different step, sequence, collage or generic character portrait. Input reference with the clay cafe defines MATERIAL STYLE only; character model references define IDENTITY/PROPORTIONS only. Do not copy the cafe into a gym/shop/clinic or copy reference poses. Follow this scene's camera and action. Never let food, hair or environment become more realistic than the characters.'''
   e.update(prompt=p,actual_direction=action,target_art_direction='hand-moulded-plasticine-v2');(ROOT/'prompts'/f'{e['stem']}.txt').write_text(p+'\n')
  critical=['salon-transformation_work','salon-fade_blend','salon-meet-stylist_signature','salon-meet-stylist_intro','salon-transformation_reveal','cafe-morning-ritual_pastry','cafe-first-visit_pour','restaurant-date-night_dish','restaurant-chef-pick_hands','salon-nail-set_turns','restaurant-date-night_outro']
  original=m['canonical_queue'];m['canonical_queue']=[s for s in critical if s in original]+[s for s in original if s not in critical]
  (ROOT/'manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(m,indent=2)+'\n')
 (ROOT/'style-v2.md').write_text('# Whole-world plasticine\n\n'+WORLD+'\n\n'+IDENTITIES+'\n\n'+CONSTRAINTS+'\n')
 print('PLASTICINE_V2_PREPARED',m['steps'],m['unique_illustrations'])
if __name__=='__main__':main()
